ADMIN CONTROLS

Disable Law:
/function law:control {enabled:0}

Enable it:
/function law:control {enabled:1}

The choice persists through /reload and does not reset Credit Scores.

EXPORT LOGS

Get all:
/function godgift:logs {clear:0}

One online player:
/function godgift:player {player:"Name"}

Carried boxes are snapshots. Place one to join sync. Adding or removing from a placed box updates every registered box.

REPLACEMENT BOXES

Kondom:
/function kingdom:allowlist {kingdom:"kondom"}

Lulu Village:
/function kingdom:allowlist {kingdom:"lulu/village"}

Only name tags count. Removing a tag revokes that player's build access.
